    "answer": {
      "short": "$1.26\\ \\text{m}^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}A &= \\frac{\\theta}{360}\\pi r^2 \\\\ A &= \\frac{100}{360}\\pi(1.2)^2 \\\\ A &= \\frac{2\\pi}{5}\\ \\text{m}^2 \\\\ A &\\approx 1.26\\ \\text{m}^2\\end{align*}$$",
